I agree with your assessment here, the error typically occurs when some component was not processed during the AOT compilation process, such that the JIT compiler is requested as fallback. I suspect this happens in one of your libraries, it could be that ngcc is not compiling some libraries. If you do indeed have a reproduction you can share, that would help in identifying the root cause.

